 1)","synopsis":"Urino has a plan to catch the arsonist in the act.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11068268/screencap/6808b70a37204.jpg"},{"title":"Suspicious Summer (Part 2)","synopsis":"Urino's rules spark escalating arson; Hiyori supports him while Osanai gives advice as bonds shift.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11068272/screencap/68120d1a713d8.jpg"},{"title":"Midsummer Night","synopsis":"Urino and Kobato both arrive at the site of the final fire.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11068273/screencap/681b425a66a67.jpg"},{"title":"Autumn Returns","synopsis":"Kobato explains to Osanai how he arrived at his conclusion about the arsonist’s identity.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11068274/screencap/682461d81f08b.jpg"},{"title":"Should We Really Have Met?","synopsis":"Kobato remembers his encounter with Osanai when they were in middle school.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11068275/screencap/682db07b7fa0e.jpg"},{"title":"Kobato-kun and Osanai-san","synopsis":"Kobato wakes up in the hospital and sees a box of chocolates with a message from Osanai.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11068276/screencap/683707cb6d418.jpg"},{"title":"Please Water the Dried Flowers","synopsis":"In the hospital, Kobato thinks back to the circumstances around Hisaka's car injury in middle school.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11068277/screencap/684024822675a.jpg"},{"title":"The End of What Seemed Like a Golden Age","synopsis":"Kobato finally manages to see Osanai in the hospital, revealing a sinister and terrifying truth.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11181602/screencap/6849497864757.jpg"},{"title":"Just Deserts","synopsis":"Kobato and Osanai finally find out the whole truth and get help from an old acquaintance.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/11181603/screencap/6855355dd9c4b.jpg"}],"fields":{},"episodes":{}}
